//     arithmetic punctuation (`!`, `?`, `;`, `@`, `#`, `$`, `&`, `_`, `\n`)
//     during inside-span generation, and a span-length cap that force-closes
//     the runaway span by directly appending a literal `">>"` token and
//     exiting span state. Force-close sacrifices accuracy for that one
//     example but recovers syntax validity (presence of `<< ... >>`).
//
// Outside spans we keep UnconstrainedChunk for amortized free reasoning text.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
