// already-generated tokens. The repetition penalty directly attacks the
// "!!!!!!" runaway-token failure mode by lowering logits of recently emitted
// tokens. When the constrained span length passes a threshold without becoming
// complete, switch to SafeBoostedConstrainedStep with arithmetic-closure tokens
// ("=", digits) heavily boosted to push the prefix into a parser-complete state
// where CloseConstrainedSpan can fire. Updated prompt guidance directs the
// model to emit a COMPLETE combined formula inside the final << >>, addressing
// the dominant mode_A failure where extracted answers were intermediate
// sub-expressions.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
